Underlying source material: not ours to license
-----------------------------------------------
The evidence exports quote values from insurers' own machine-readable
provider directory files, published under 45 CFR 156.230(c), and compare them
against federal registry snapshots (NPPES) and CMS public use files. Those
upstream sources are US government works or issuer publications and carry
their own terms. The CC0 dedication above covers this project's compilation,
scoring and evidence selection, not the upstream files themselves.

Provider information appearing in evidence rows is quoted from what an
insurer published. It is not a claim about any individual provider, and
listed clinicians are often unaware of how they appear in payer directories.
